    "A key is already stored in Keychain": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钥匙串中已保存密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A layout puts named apps at fixed sizes on chosen displays, in one pass.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "布局会把指定应用按固定尺寸一次放到选定显示器上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A New Conversation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新对话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pattern without a slash matches any file or folder name, like *.tmp or node_modules;  one with a slash matches the whole path, like **/[Cc]ache/**. The built-in patterns  always apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不含斜杠的模式匹配任意文件或文件夹名，例如 *.tmp 或 node_modules；含斜杠的模式匹配完整路径，例如 **/[Cc]ache/**。内置模式始终生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quicklink appears here once its link contains an {argument}, which the query fills in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "链接里包含 {argument} 的快捷链接会出现在这里，查询词会填入该占位符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A shortcut works even when its command is hidden from the launcher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使命令在启动器中隐藏，快捷键仍然有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tiny, native macOS launcher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻量的原生 macOS 启动器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
