      }
    },
    "Apple Shortcuts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快捷指令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's own translator runs on this Mac, so it costs nothing and reaches no provider; a language downloads the first time you use it. Binding a model to %@ replaces the translator, and that route bills like any other.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "苹果自带翻译在本机运行，不产生费用、也不会发往任何提供方；某种语言会在首次使用时下载。给「%@」绑定模型后会替换该翻译器，并按普通模型计费。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's translator": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "苹果翻译"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applications": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用程序"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applied when the default model supports reasoning effort.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在默认模型支持推理强度时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applied when the selected model supports reasoning effort.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在所选模型支持推理强度时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Argument": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask a follow-up about this…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对此内容继续追问…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask Each Chat puts the first tool call of every conversation through a confirmation. Never Allow withholds the server without removing it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「每次对话询问」会在每次对话的第一次工具调用时确认。「永不允许」会停用该服务器但不删除它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask first when deleting a quicklink from the launcher's Actions menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从启动器操作菜单删除快捷链接前先确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask for it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "询问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the handler for a new window instead of reusing its frontmost tab. Only apps that accept a new-window argument can honour this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求处理程序打开新窗口，而不是复用最前面的标签页。只有接受新窗口参数的应用才会生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authorization": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authorization"
          }
        }
      }
