    "Delores": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delores"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delores (default sprite)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delores (默认小精灵)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delores always tells the model to return only the transformed text, and to treat your selection as material rather than as instructions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delores 总会要求模型只返回转换后的文本，并把你的选区当作材料而不是指令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delores can't read or move other apps' windows until it is granted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在授予权限前，Delores 无法读取或移动其他应用的窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delores can't read your selection until it is granted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在授予权限前，Delores 无法读取选区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delores could not find the %@ command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delores 找不到 %@ 命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delores needs Accessibility access to remap keys.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delores 需要辅助功能权限才能重映射按键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delores privately learns which results you choose for each query. Reset all learned choices to restore the default order.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delores 会在本机私下学习你每次查询选择的结果。重置全部学习记录即可恢复默认顺序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delores sends your selected text to the model with these instructions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delores 会把所选文本连同这些指令发给模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delores uses the Codex, Claude and OpenCode commands already installed and signed in on this Mac. Delores never stores or asks for their API keys.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delores 使用这台 Mac 上已经安装并登录的 Codex、Claude 和 OpenCode 命令。Delores 不会存储或索要它们的 API 密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delores will relearn your preferred results as you use the launcher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你继续使用启动器时，Delores 会重新学习你偏好的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
