          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Connection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file has moved or been deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件已被移动或删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The companion is a Surface, not a second chat client: it has no actions, history or model of its own. It hands you to the Context or Command Surface, which own those.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "桌宠是一个 Surface，不是第二个聊天客户端：它没有自己的操作、历史或模型。它会把你交给拥有这些能力的上下文或命令 Surface。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The companion that is simply there: it wanders the edge of the display, and reopens your last selection when you double-click it. ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它只是在那里：沿着屏幕边缘走动，双击即可重新打开上次的选区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Context Bar is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上下文栏已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The level of transparency of the glass background.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "玻璃背景的透明程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The login Keychain could not be accessed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法访问登录钥匙串。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model returned nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型没有返回任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel can still translate into another language once it is open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "面板打开后仍可翻译成另一种语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The password you set when exporting from Raycast.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你从 Raycast 导出时设置的密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are the buttons on the bar that appears when you select text. A row without its own model follows the one chosen in the Quick Actions pane. %@ keeps Apple's translator until you bind a model to it, and falls back to that shared model for a language Apple's translator does not have.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些是划词后出现在栏上的按钮。没有单独模型的行会跟随快捷操作窗格中的选择。「%@」在绑定模型前使用苹果翻译；遇到苹果没有的语言时，回退到共享模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thirds": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三分之一"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This display isn't connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此显示器未连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This doesn't look like a URL, file path, or deeplink.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这看起来不像 URL、文件路径或深度链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This location no longer exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此位置已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This model is already added.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此模型已添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tools from every enabled server are offered to the model; type @slug to address one directly. The first call of a chat asks before it runs. Credentials stay in your login Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有已启用服务器的工具都会提供给模型；输入 @slug 可直接指定某一个。每次聊天的第一次调用会先询问。凭据保存在登录钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translate to": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trigger Caps Lock (⇪)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触发大写锁定 (⇪)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trigger Escape": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触发 Escape"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Triggering a half again re-applies the same frame.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再次触发对半命令会重新应用同一位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Triggering a half again steps it through a third and two thirds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再次触发对半命令会在三分之一和三分之二之间切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Triggering a half again walks it to the next half across your displays, wrapping around.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再次触发对半命令会把它移到下一块显示器的对应半边，并循环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off the companion": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭宠物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Enable Quick Actions to show it when you select text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开「启用快捷操作」后，划词时才会显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two sizes only, because it is drawn at a whole number of its own pixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有两种尺寸，因为它按自身像素的整数倍绘制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "URL": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "URL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use an installed account or connect an API endpoint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用已安装的账户，或连接 API 端点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用默认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the clipboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用剪贴板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used by Delores features unless they ask you to choose another model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "供 Delores 各功能使用，除非它们让你另选模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used by every action without a model of its own, %@ included for a pair Apple's translator cannot do.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "供所有没有单独模型的操作使用；「%@」在苹果翻译无法处理的语言对时也会用到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used every time %@ runs from the bar on the text you have selected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次从栏上对所选文本运行 %@ 时都会使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UUID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UUID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Value": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@ · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Web search": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网页搜索"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whaledou (whale bean)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whaledou (鲸鱼豆豆)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Escape does once the search field is already empty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "搜索框已经为空时，Escape 键做什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What summoning AI Chat lands on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "唤出 AI 聊天时落到哪里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What {selection} does when the app in front exposes nothing to read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前应用没有可读选区时，{selection} 怎么处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What ↵ does on an entry; ⌘↵ does the other one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在条目上按 ↵ 执行的操作；⌘↵ 执行另一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When there's no selected text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有选中文本时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window Capabilities": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口能力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window commands": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window Layouts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口布局"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window Management": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口管理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With nothing bound this row keeps Apple's translator; a pair it does not have falls back to the shared model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未绑定时此行继续使用苹果翻译；遇到它没有的语言对时，回退到共享模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write your whole library to a JSON file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把整个库写入 JSON 文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written back into the selection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已写回原文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Xiao Hei (black cat)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Xiao Hei (罗小黑/黑猫)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your home folder expands to its visible folders and cloud drives, never to its Library.  An empty list searches nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主文件夹会展开为可见文件夹和云盘，不会进入资源库。空列表表示不搜索任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your text is sent ahead of every message in every chat, after what Delores already tells the model about itself. Both are billed again on each turn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的文本会加在每条消息前面，位于 Delores 对自身的说明之后。两者都会在每一轮重新计费。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "© 2026 Abue Ammar · Released under AGPL-3.0": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "© 2026 Abue Ammar · 以 AGPL-3.0 发布"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "✦ %@ in progress…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✦ 正在%@…"
          }
        }
      }
